From kenneth.scheve at yale.edu  Tue Jun 17 10:02:29 2003
From: kenneth.scheve at yale.edu (Kenneth Scheve)
Date: Tue, 17 Jun 2003 10:02:29 -0400
Subject: [amelia] helps with miest and svy command
